{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act37side_level_act37side_st02",
  "groupId": "act37side",
  "stageId": "act37side_st02",
  "title": "童話的結局",
  "storyCode": "GO-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5729b0b2f7e1bb2fe88e670fea1129ebe7668a89107df16c34180c6c7a51732a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "55_g7_repairedlentiavenue"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>諾伯特區街道</><p=2>1098年12月26日 5:23 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達，你那邊情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黎恩老大還活著，但瘸了一條腿。他最好的兄弟，沒撐過來，我問了當年的老熟人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人確切知道他那個兄弟是什麼時候走的，可能是在當初逃離諾伯特區時，也可能是在聯軍反攻時被那些走投無路的薩卡茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你見到黎恩老大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見到了，他現在在貨港工作，不太提起過去的事情，也從不談他的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他說現在最重要的就是好好活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……*維多利亞粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也去逛了一圈以前罩著的那些工廠，結果現在全是些沒見過的毛頭小子，甚至連我們格拉斯哥幫的名字都沒聽過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幫小鬼真是欠揍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你有去過我們常去的那家老餐館嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拆了。議會那邊派人來聯絡街區許多店鋪的原主人，對於那些爛到沒辦法修、原主人又找不到的店，全都準備拆掉重建。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日落街飯店、保羅的酒吧，還有那個卡西米爾小子開的雜誌鋪……都沒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還去了他們說的那片公共墓地，但我沒找到麥克拉倫，也沒找到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哽咽）他媽的，為什麼那些墓碑都不刻上名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽的，我怎麼能在你面前哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我們回家。摩根恐怕早就等不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原以為……拳館的狀況會更糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來你一直有幫忙照看這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想著如果你們還活著，總有一天會回來……不管怎麼說，我也算是格拉斯哥幫的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初你沒跟我們一起上溫德米爾公爵的軍艦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒廢到需要那些公爵貴族來救我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過……我得承認，當時我的確有點傻。後來我帶著一群兄弟一直在諾伯特區周圍剿那些魔族佬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從那些魔族佬嘴裡聽說了典範軍的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們做了一件我從來不敢想的事，哈哈，軍隊……外面的戰場翻天覆地的時候，我也和其他人一起去了前線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們能做的不多，最後還受了些傷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你也感染了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊……聽說因陀羅也是不久前在戰場上受了傷才被感染的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有你們這些朋友在，她可真幸運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摩根愣住了，因為她從沒想過這個問題，甚至連因陀羅自己都沒想過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對、不對，怎麼聽你這麼說，感覺哪裡怪怪的？呃……可是我一時也說不上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，隨便吧。總之如果有機會，幫我向推進之王說聲抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以留下來自己跟她說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的格拉斯哥幫已經不在了，既然你們都回來了，我也該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴菲恩沒和你們一起回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她留在維娜身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，看來你們之間也吵了一架。我從廣播裡聽說了戴菲恩她母親的事……不管她的身分是什麼，至少她是個有種的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你接下來要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諾伯特區重建還需要人手，貨港每天都有貨物從城外運進來，我跟兄弟們還得幫忙盯著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後……然後再去把中央區來的那群混帳商人揍一頓——呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧。摩根，諾伯特區已經變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我熟悉的人不在了，常去的店也沒了，街區裡一堆什麼都不懂的臭小子妄想爭個高下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——反正，拳館還給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廣播裡議會說了很多新鮮事，我跟幾個兄弟也談好了，過陣子就去別的公爵領看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會找到新地盤的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡鐸爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_862_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新的地盤、新的開始。有些事，我得花點時間才能忘掉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，剛剛出去的是卡鐸爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他來和我們告別，順帶把它還給我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她拿出一柄蝴蝶刀，刀刃上雖然有些缺口，但依舊能清楚看到格拉斯哥幫的標誌。\n貝爾德的蝴蝶刀——漢娜怎麼可能認錯？那個標記還是當年她打贏貝爾德後硬要刻上去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡鐸爾是從一個死掉的清理人身上找到的……但他翻遍了整個地方也沒有找到貝爾德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也去過那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只在牆上看到一些已經模糊的字，後來又下了雨，痕跡幾乎被沖刷殆盡。但我敢肯定……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她去過那裡，我認得她的筆跡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我也希望”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，當初在映像廳看電影時，貝爾德最討厭那種哭哭啼啼的悼念場面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，她從來不覺得死亡是件值得悲傷的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把刀給我吧，我找個地方把它掛在牆上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我去拿酒。慶祝回家，也敬貝爾德！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們要不要等等維娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒空回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可萬一——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，那我們就等到徹底喝醉之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒，從來不等人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大，人帶回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是……真的不會出事嗎？畢竟從議會面前把死刑犯的屍體弄走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有某些人默許，你覺得光憑你，真的能把人帶出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個哥倫比亞人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情緒不太穩定……老大，確定要讓他來運這批貨嗎？萬一——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“銑痕”沒有回答，只是沉默著。傭兵嘆了口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了……老大，我不是故意想惹你生氣，只是上次議會對我們動手後，大家還是有點後怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……和你們無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會搞定那個哥倫比亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃利西奧先生，想必我不用向你自我介紹了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“銑痕”……我知道你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，那我就不多費口舌了。我需要你幫我掩護一批貨物離開倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，這不是單方面的交易。我可以順帶幫你把那個已經“死掉”的人送出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開倫蒂尼姆，越遠越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“銑痕”，她叫黛安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我眼裡，她是誰都不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重要的是，她不會再出現在倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你把這當作回報？讓一個剛剛回家的人被迫離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃利西奧先生，你應該很清楚，她不能留在城裡。對所有人而言，她已經死了，死在絞刑架上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜做了一件蠢事。只要這個人還活著，只要她還待在城內，遲早會變成某些人捅向維娜的一把刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，維娜應該要更果決一點的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃利西奧先生，她的感染狀況，你比我更清楚。她活不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，你可以選擇不做。但這個麻煩，我還是會幫維娜解決——用我的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說過你的傳聞，“銑痕”，或者該說——阿勒黛·坎伯蘭閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的故事有許多版本，但無一例外，你曾經的確稱得上是“永遠高潔的坎伯蘭”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，我會帶黛安離開。在哥倫比亞，我能更好地照顧她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣你滿意了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是個善良的人，埃利西奧先生。能有你這樣的朋友，是她的幸運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備好，你隨時都可能出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……要嘛像個英雄一樣死去，要嘛活下來眼睜睜看著自己變成惡人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去的你，有想過自己會變成現在這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，又何止是我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銑痕”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場戰爭中，活下來的英雄何止千萬。從最耀眼奪目的，到如今已被世人遺忘的，我也想看看當現實擺在眼前，他們最終會變成什麼樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深陷在草地裡的士兵感受到一絲微微的癢意，寒風吹動草葉，輕輕撫過她的臉頰。\n死後的大地，就是這樣的嗎？她睜開眼，卻看見了一個意想不到的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸——啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，埃利西奧。黛安小姐，你不該什麼都不說就自己去做那些危險的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——我記得我在絞刑架上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，在那些親眼目睹行刑的人眼中你的確已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開前我特意請羅德島的人幫你做了詳細的檢查，結果並不樂觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的許多重要器官已經結晶化，換句話說，源石已經在某種程度上取代了它們的功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……我沒死？……這算是幸運，還是不幸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不確定議長閣下是不是提前知道這個才……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是維娜放了我？她真傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實說，我真的搞不懂你們這些人。唉……不過，黛安小姐，你恐怕不能再回倫蒂尼姆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這時她才終於確認他們已經離開倫蒂尼姆了。她看到不遠處那條被移動城市碾壓出的巨大輪胎印。\n而前方，幾個薩卡茲孩子在草地上奔跑，朝她招手。\n背井離鄉的薩卡茲人大多眼神迷茫。他們可以去任何地方，卻沒有一個地方，能夠真正稱之為“家”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛安小姐，我會帶你去哥倫比亞，在那裡，我或許能更好地幫助你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊。哥倫比亞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得說過如果有機會的話，我很樂意去看看你口中的哥倫比亞到底是什麼樣的地方……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃利西奧先生，我們離哥倫比亞有多遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，很遠，我拿地圖給你看看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的狀況，還能撐到那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1519_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我明白了。埃利西奧，可以答應我一件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛安小姐，我知道你想說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到那一天，我會帶你回家，回到倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃利西奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_487_bobb_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也很好奇，到了那時，倫蒂尼姆又會變成什麼樣子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……維娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……被子，誰幫我蓋的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，頭好痛，現在是幾點了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，我不是說過不要每次都喝這麼多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，漢娜她們大大咧咧的，你不該盯著點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯？維娜？維娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摩根敏捷地從沙發上彈起，越過矮桌，直接撲向了維娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，你回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為，我以為……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，你怎麼不叫醒我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天不是你一直在說維娜絕對不會回來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，結果現在最激動的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘴硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小聲點，摩根，達格達還沒醒呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "枕在因陀羅腿上的人動了動耳朵，依舊沉浸在酒精帶來的夢境中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來達格達喝得最多，我整理出不少空瓶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，她心情很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，希望我沒有遲到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，摩根，你昨天可不是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（閉嘴，漢娜！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎回家，維娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g2_glasgowoldroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來想更快趕回來的，但議會那邊實在有太多麻煩事需要處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那……你怎麼又……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，只能暫時辛苦號角小姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她恐怕現在才發現我偷偷溜出來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你……還是得回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我不能逃避責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也欠你們一個道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，你不用——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，推進之王？維娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我睡了多久？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，還沒久到錯過維娜回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……牆上那把蝴蝶刀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是她的。卡鐸爾送回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡鐸爾？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得這個地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然我們比比看，這次誰跑得比較快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "維娜話還沒說完，因陀羅已經衝了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漢娜，你作弊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她又沒說要倒數。這個位置還是我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因陀羅，你受傷之後，明顯變慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你追上我再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？等等我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別掉隊，戴菲恩，跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽到了嗎，“小戴菲”，你可是慢了不少呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾道身影快速穿過街區，剛下工回家的工人們好奇地看著這群張揚奔跑的人。\n他們一時想不起來，這群人到底是誰——\n“大概又是些剛搬來諾伯特區的外地人吧。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她們跑上工廠間的高架，格拉斯哥幫又回到了自己熟悉的地方。\n在這裡，她們能俯瞰低矮的工廠，也能遠遠望見中央區碎片大廈高聳的尖角。\n她們從這裡出發，也曾從這裡告別家鄉。兜兜轉轉，她們再度回到了這個熟悉的地方。\n只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也留了一杯給貝爾德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達，你不再來點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要，我不想又再在維娜面前失態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那剛好，你那杯全分給維娜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“小戴菲”，你確定只喝果汁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，別這麼叫我……我還是不太習慣酒精的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨便，反正我會盯著你們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好耶！就該他媽的在這裡喝酒才對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬貝爾德！敬格拉斯哥幫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "所有人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬貝爾德！敬格拉斯哥幫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬羅德島！敬典範軍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬所有在這場戰爭中戰鬥的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，還有——敬所有願意付出生命，踏上回家之路的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬所有還活著的，敬那些已經離去的人……敬所有依舊陪伴在我們身邊的人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——敬每一位曾付出努力與淚水的人，每一位曾在黑暗與痛苦中掙扎過的人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……敬維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "所有人",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬維多利亞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不該悲傷。活著的人，銘記當下；離去的人，也留下了希望。\n羽獸們盤旋低鳴，仿佛在附和著她們的話語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你也要走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是暫時的，我得回一趟麗茵卡登。希勒少尉會和我一起回去療養。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正你要是被你家裡那些混帳氣個半死，隨時都能回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡也是你的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然！我還答應了維娜呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，如果有一天你真的不想扛了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我想，我還有能做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望倫蒂尼姆的人能夠幸福快樂，也希望所有人都能過上真正美好的生活，這是他們應得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都應該像我們一樣歡笑，沒有眼淚，也沒有飢餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想讓我們爭取到的一切白費——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有人想搶走，我就打回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像過去我們在這裡做的那樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜也好，亞歷山德莉娜也罷，對我來說，沒有什麼區別，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是貝爾德還在，她也一定希望我這麼做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，維娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也希望如此……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬格拉斯哥幫，敬你們大家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎回家，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
